  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After the Myriad Dragon Dock deal for a seventy percent Blood Deity remnant recipe, Fang Yuan next thinks about Vicious Lightning Fiend, past-life career and Fang Yuan’s earlier failed plot for that recipe. In Fang Yuan’s previous-life memory, Vicious Lightning Fiend reached rank seven with fierce battle strength and used the immortal killer move Lightning Deity in the five regions chaotic war to accumulate eight rank six battle strength beings similar to blue charm lightning shadows.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_myriad_dragon_dock",
        "rcp_blood_deity_immortal_gu_recipe",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life, after Feng Jiu Ge died, Vicious Lightning Fiend contested for first place among rank seven and fought Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei for three days and three nights before losing.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_shi_lei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend comprehends Lightning Deity from a Blood Deity remnant recipe after several years of closed cultivation, and that multi-year effort stands as Fang Yuan’s measure of how hard an immortal killer move is to design even with a remnant recipe to work from.",
      "chapters": [
        736
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creation-timeline",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later account instead puts the creation at two years of closed cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        839
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creation-timeline",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Vicious Lightning Fiend’s several years on lightning deity, Fang Yuan’s own speed while reworking vajra shell runs more than ten times as fast.",
      "chapters": [
        1314
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creation-timeline",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creation-timeline",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "creation-timeline",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After leaving closed cultivation, he uses Lightning Deity and challenges many Gu Immortals. At one report he has battled more than twenty, with only one draw and one loss, and meddlesome Gu Immortals already compare him with Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei.",
      "chapters": [
        776
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenge-record",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After seclusion he roams Central Continent challenging Gu Immortals, mostly winning, and the lightning deities he owns rise to three as he gains resources from spars and duels. With three lightning deities his battle strength surpasses ordinary rank seven Gu Immortals, and he has victories against rank seven opponents while still rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        839
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "deity-count",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Song Zi Xing confronts him, Song Zi Xing grants that Lightning Deity can force open Blood Tu Su, then questions whether Vicious Lightning Fiend’s escape methods can outrun blood rainbow flash.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
